/* 荒野与近郊小支线 / 10 条 × 3 段 / 海蚀洞·猎人小径·风车·湖畔废屋·栈道·矿道·海盗船·石环·盐场·废工坊 */
:: MP Wild Sea Cave [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
海水退到膝盖以下，海蚀洞的入口才露出来。洞顶挂着湿黑的鼻涕藻，滴下来的水在石面上敲出细响。你踩着碎贝壳往里走，盐味越来越重，风却停了。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回浅滩 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave">
<<caveicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<link "把箱拖进干洞 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_sea_cave_roster"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_roster"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用一片牡蛎壳刮掉锁孔里的盐垢，听见簧片轻轻一响。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石阶探看 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">锈屑扎进掌心，锁舌纹丝不动。你换了个角度硬撬，箱角在岩壁上磕出一声闷响。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回海礁石岸 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">把箱拖进干洞 (0:05)（潜行不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "绕到箱后查看 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_sea_cave_roster"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_roster"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你顺着盐霜侵蚀的字迹逐行辨认，从值班表边角的折痕里理出了航道脉络。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">潮湿纸页粘连在一起，你揭动时指腹被粗糙木棱磨得发烫，一时没能认全字迹。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Sea Cave Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
干洞只有一张床那么大。你把箱子拖上高处，油布一揭开，咸腥味里混进了一股旧墨水的酸气。里面是三十七张灯塔值班表，纸页被潮气粘成一块，最上面那张的日期停在三十年前的十一月。
<<if $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_roster"]>><span class="teal">对照石壁刻痕算出的退潮时刻，你趁海水未漫进干洞前迅速揭开了油布箱。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回浅滩 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抄最后三页 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_sea_cave_coordinates"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_coordinates"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你从被盐水泡开的笔画里认出一串坐标，还有一句潦草的附注：退潮后，从第三块黑礁往洞里数七步。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">盐水把墨迹泡成了灰雾，你只能认出零星的数字。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "摸箱底夹层 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-sea-cave-step2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_sea_cave_roster'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_sea_cave_coordinates"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_coordinates"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[上前印证 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Wild Sea Cave Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Sea Cave Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_sea_cave_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
洞外的浪声变了。不是刚才那种散漫的拍打，而是连续不断的推挤，水线已经漫过你进来的那条斜坡。你抱起油布包，脚底的石面开始发滑。
<<if $mpClues["wild_sea_cave_coordinates"]>><span class="teal">你记着三十七张值班表背面拼出的礁石水道坐标，抱起油布包踩准了斜坡干处。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	你算准两波浪之间的空档，贴着岩壁横移出去。海水没到胸口时，脚终于踩到一条熟悉的礁脊。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 900>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 420>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	一股回流把你推向洞壁，膝盖撞上暗礁，油布包脱手漂了出去。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从礁石翻回 (0:04)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 4>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[沿沙滩走回去 (0:06)|Beach]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Hunter Trail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
猎人小径在去年秋天就被落叶埋了一半。你从一截倒木上跨过去，靴底压碎了几颗橡子。前方泥地本该有鹿蹄印，可你看见的却是一串更深的掌印：四趾，前掌宽，后掌窄，步幅比人短，比狗大。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林缘 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail">
<<runicon>><<link "沿掌印追进蕨丛 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail">>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_hunter_tracks"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_hunter_tracks"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你踩着沟边裸露的树根借力，一步跳到对岸，鞋底只在湿泥上滑了半寸。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[前往下一处 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">树根在你脚下断开，你半个身子滑进沟里，膝盖磕在石头上。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "检查那截绳套 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_hunter_tracks"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_hunter_tracks"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你顺着器物纹理巧施寸劲，原本卡滞的关窍应声松开。<span class="green">你将内里藏着的收获稳稳纳入怀中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Hunter Trail Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
小径尽头的空地比别处干净，像有人经常在这里停下。两棵幼桦之间挂着半截绳套，绳结离地不到一尺。上面的毛更多，还混着几缕暗红色的纤维。
<<if $mpClues["wild_hunter_tracks"]>><span class="teal">顺着泥地上那行压低脚尖的旧猎靴印，你在两棵幼桦间发现了半掩的绳套。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林缘 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail-step2">
<<sneakicon>><<link "躲倒木后等等 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_hunter_snare"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_hunter_snare"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你顺着绳股退开活结，发现里面藏着一圈细铜丝。这不是普通猎套，是有人用来活捉的。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">活结在你手里越收越紧，粗麻勒进指节。你用力一扯，绳套弹开，铜丝却划破了虎口。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿窄路追上 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-hunter-trail-step2">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_hunter_tracks'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_hunter_snare"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_hunter_snare"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你听准猎径上的落枝声，趁空档把绊脚的藤蔓拨到路边。<span class="green">猎径重新变得好走。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤查证 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	内里的阻力比看上去沉得多，你试着扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Wild Hunter Trail Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Hunter Trail Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_hunter_trail_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
蕨丛深处传来脚步声。很轻，落脚时先压脚尖，再慢慢放下脚跟，像不想惊动地面。一个披着旧斗篷的人从树影里走出来，手里提着一只空水袋。斗篷下摆沾着泥，袖口有新鲜的撕口。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>>
	是伊甸。<</if>>
对方没有抢绳套，只把水袋放在地上，往你这边推了推。
<<if $mpClues["wild_hunter_snare"]>><span class="teal">你手里攥着方才解下的暗红纤维绳套，林影里走出的斗篷猎人见状放下了戒心。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 340>>
	你没有退。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 420>><<set _reward to 520>><<else>><<set _reward to 360>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你被那道旧疤和身后的动静分了神，后退时踩断一根枯枝。对方立刻提起水袋，转身没入蕨丛。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[绕出溪沟 (0:12)|Farmland]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿小径回林缘 (0:05)|Forest]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Windmill Flags [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
农场西边的旧风车已经很久没有磨过麦子，叶片却转得很稳。你走近才发现，每片叶骨的末端都绑着一条布：红、白、蓝、黑，颜色顺序每隔一阵就换一次。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags">
<<investigateicon>><<link "爬上风车查看 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_windmill_flags"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_windmill_flags"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你把颜色按长短重新排开，看出这是一套很旧的田间信号：红是收工，白是换垄，蓝是有人来查，黑是不要靠近。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石阶探看 (0:04)|Farmland]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你只记住了颜色，没记住间隔。风一换向，布条绞在叶骨上，顺序全乱了。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "绕田埂问雇工 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_windmill_flags"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_windmill_flags"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你稳住呼吸沉住气观察片刻，在不起眼的夹缝间看清了端倪。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">冷风吹得你肩头微僵，稍一分神便错过了最佳时机。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回农场田埂 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Windmill Flags Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你顺着外侧的铁梯爬上风车平台。木板被太阳晒得发白，踩上去却会往下陷。叶轮从头顶扫过，带起的风有股陈年麦壳味。
<<if $mpClues["wild_windmill_flags"]>><span class="teal">你记着四片风车叶轮上布条的红白排序，顺着外侧铁梯稳稳爬上了高处木台。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags-step2">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320>><<link "收信号簿 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_windmill_schedule"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_windmill_schedule"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用剪子尖挑开铆钉旁的暗扣，取出一本卷边的信号簿。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Farmland]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">暗扣弹回，剪子尖在铆钉上滑出一道火星。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回农场 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">收信号簿 (0:05)（潜行不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "下田埂拦人 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-windmill-flags-step2">>
<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_windmill_flags'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_windmill_schedule"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_windmill_schedule"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你借着微光看清细微缝隙，指尖轻拨便理顺了症结。<span class="green">你把暗格深处的旧物一举取了出来。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[上前印证 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	周围忽然传来一阵零碎脚步声，惊得你连忙收住动作。<span class="red">时机不对，你决定等风声过去再试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Wild Windmill Flags Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回农场 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Windmill Flags Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_windmill_flags_payout")>><</if>>
你从铁梯下到一半，风突然停了。四片叶轮同时垂下来，布条软软地贴在木骨上。田埂上的人已经不见了，麦田里却多出两道朝西坡去的新车辙。云从北边压过来，空气里能闻见雨。
<<if $mpClues["wild_windmill_schedule"]>><span class="teal">对照木骨内侧抄下的风向停机时刻表，你一眼看出了西坡麦田新车辙的去向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你沿叶骨爬到最高处，把黑布一条条解下，重新系成「白、红、白」的寻常信号。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 520>><<set _reward to 800>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 600>><<else>><<set _reward to 400>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你爬到第三片叶骨时，鞋底在湿木上打滑，整个人吊在半空。布条被扯断，红布飘进麦田。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿林缘回森林 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回农场 (0:05)|Farmland]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Lake House [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
湖面比天色亮。废屋架在浅水的木桩上，墙根一圈深绿，分得清哪几年涨过水。你踩着露出水面的旧栈桥走过去，木板一块高一块低，缝隙里长着细白的芦苇芽。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回街口 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-lake-house">
<<investigateicon>><<link "沿外墙数窗 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-lake-house">>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>><<if _sk gte 340>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_lake_house_cups"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_lake_house_cups"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你没有急着跨进去，先数了一遍杯子，又从一数到七。心跳慢下来。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[前往下一处 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你盯着水面，忽然觉得每一只杯子里都映着同一扇窗。</span><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "从厨房侧门摸进 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-lake-house">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_lake_house_cups"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_lake_house_cups"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你先稳住下盘重心，再分寸不差地完成了最后一步。<span class="green">阻碍迎刃而解，手头收获已贴身收好。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	器物边角沾着湿滑的潮气，你捏紧使劲时还是滑脱了一下。<span class="red">掌心擦出一道红印，眼下未能得手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">从厨房侧门摸进 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Lake House Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
屋里的墙比外面薄。你伸手敲了敲，声音发空，像木板后面还有一层。每一扇窗都嵌在同一条视线上，站在任何一扇窗前，湖心那座小岛都正好落在窗格中央。
<<if $mpClues["wild_lake_house_cups"]>><span class="teal">你想起木桌上两只尚有余温的旧茶杯，顺着视线敲出了木墙后方的空心夹层。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回街口 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-lake-house-step2">
<<walkicon>><<link "跟湿脚印到后墙 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-lake-house-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_lake_house_names"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_lake_house_names"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你把七张纸按人名首字母排开，认出其中四个姓属于湖边旧船户。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Forest]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">水汽把纸粘得太牢，你一揭就破。碎片落在桌面上，像几片湿雪。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "掀开壁炉沙层 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-lake-house-step2">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_lake_house_cups'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_lake_house_names"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_lake_house_names"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你换了个顺手的角度切入，原本棘手的阻碍顿时迎刃而解。<span class="green">不费吹灰之力便拿到了里层物件。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤查证 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	光线忽明忽暗晃花了眼，你探手的角度差了毫厘。<span class="red">指节磕在硬物上生疼，只得暂且作罢。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Wild Lake House Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Lake House Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_lake_house_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
壁炉后的沙层下面是一块活动地板。你移开木板，冷气从下面涌上来，带着湖泥和水草的腥味。地板下不是地窖，而是一间半沉在水里的暗室。湖水从墙缝里渗进来，在石阶上留下一条条白线。
<<if $mpClues["wild_lake_house_names"]>><span class="teal">对照窗框内侧刻着的那串缩写，你移开壁炉后的沙层，准确掀开了水下暗室的木板。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	你吸了口气潜进暗室，从铁架背面摸到一枚铜鱼坠子和一小卷防水纸。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 600>><<elseif _sk gte 390>><<set _reward to 450>><<else>><<set _reward to 280>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你在水里辨错了方向，肩膀撞上铁架，第七只杯子沉进湖泥。等你摸回缺口，手里只剩一把水草。<<pain 2>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿芦苇荡回林边 (0:08)|Forest]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[走旧栈桥回湖岸 (0:06)|Lake Ruin]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
峭壁栈道是新修的。木料还带着树脂味，扶手刷了深棕色的漆，接缝处却已经翘起细皮。你从入口走上去，脚下的板子发出很轻的「嗒、嗒」声，不像旧木头，也不像刚钉好的新木。
你蹲下看钉子。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk">
<<walkicon>><<link "踏上西段查看 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_cliff_old_nails"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_cliff_old_nails"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用钥匙尖挑开一个补漆的钉眼，发现钉子只进了薄薄一层，下面的旧梁早已发黑。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[沿石阶探看 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">钥匙尖一滑，钉帽翻起，木刺扎进指腹。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回峭壁街边 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "翻到栈道下 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_cliff_old_nails"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_cliff_old_nails"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你借着天光比对纸面刻痕，从磨毛的边角折印里看出了记号的规律。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你翻检得略急了些，指尖被碎石边角磨得发红，也没能当场理清头绪。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
西段入口横着一条褪色的麻绳，绳结松松垮垮，谁都能跨过去。你掀开第一块板，下面的旧梁果然还在，只是表面被刷了一层深色木蜡。新板与旧梁之间垫着碎木片，踩久了就会移位。
<<if $mpClues["wild_cliff_old_nails"]>><span class="teal">凭着栏杆底部拔出的那枚生锈旧方钉，你掀开西段首块踏板便摸到了涂蜡的旧木梁。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk-step2">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "拦住上栈道游客 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>><<if _sk gte 320>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_cliff_weak_span"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_cliff_weak_span"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你背贴岩壁，脚尖踩住裸露的石棱，一步一步挪过最薄的那段。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你踩上一块松板，板子立刻翻起。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回峭壁 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "收好送货单 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-cliff-boardwalk-step2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_cliff_old_nails'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_cliff_weak_span"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_cliff_weak_span"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你按老手传授的诀窍沉腕发力，几下便将首尾料理妥当。<span class="green">现场被你收拾得井井有条。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[上前印证 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	卡扣深处似乎锈死了，单凭眼下的手法一时难以撼动。<span class="red">小臂泛起酸意，你只得先记下位置退开。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回峭壁 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Cliff Boardwalk Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_cliff_boardwalk_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你回到入口时，三个背着画板的游客正要往西段走。领队的人手里拿着同一张检修告示，说昨天才有人来刷过漆。远处停着一辆没有标记的马车，车斗里堆着拆下来的旧木板。
<<if $mpClues["wild_cliff_weak_span"]>><span class="teal">你记着第三根横梁下被虫蛀空的承重缺口，及时在西段入口拦住了背画板的游客。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 340>>
	你没有抬高声音，只把送货单摊在画板上，指出木料数目和那个被泡开的「贝」字。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 520>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 410>><<set _reward to 520>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你被工装男人盯得迟疑了一瞬。他顺势接过送货单，说那是废纸，揉成一团塞进桶里。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回海岩 (0:12)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|Beach]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Mine Cart [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
旧矿道口的木框已经歪了，顶上垂着几缕发黑的麻绳。你弯腰钻进去，铁轨还在，枕木却烂得只剩一半。轨面上没有灰，车轮压出的亮线一直延伸到黑暗里。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回矿道 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart">
<<investigateicon>><<link "沿轨道进窄缝 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
