	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[前往下一处 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你翻来覆去也看不出石种。敲击时，石头发出闷响，粉尘扑进眼睛。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "查矿车底暗格 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_mine_white_stones"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_mine_white_stones"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你耐着性子一点点理清脉络，终于将关键线索握在手中。<span class="green">这一趟工夫没有白费，收获颇丰。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你操之过急失了准头，衣袖还在粗糙的边沿挂了一下。<span class="red">你连忙拢好衣角，打算定下神再来。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回森林小径 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Mine Cart Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
矿车底部焊着一只扁铁盒，盒盖被白石灰糊死。你用石块敲开边角，里面是一卷矿道测量图和三枚旧工牌。图上用红笔标出一条没有登记过的支道，正好穿过车斗停下的位置。
<<if $mpClues["wild_mine_white_stones"]>><span class="teal">顺着岔道口排成箭头的白石子记号，你在翻倒的矿车底部摸到了白灰封死的扁铁盒。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回矿道 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart-step2">
<<caveicon>><<link "钻进支道看看 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_mine_salt_den"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_mine_salt_den"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用铁盒盖撬开支道口的木闸，露出后面的旧通风井。井壁上有新鲜的刮痕，一路向上。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">木闸上的铁销弹脱，闸板砸下来，你缩手不及，指背被压出一道血痕。</span><<pain 3>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_mine_white_stones'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link "推矿车回岔道 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-mine-cart-step2">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_mine_white_stones'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_mine_salt_den"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_mine_salt_den"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你趁周围无人留意果断出手，眨眼间便把事情办得滴水不漏。<span class="green">顺手起出了封存完好的贴身收存。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤查证 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗处的缝隙比预想更窄，手指探进去半分便被卡住。<span class="red">指腹磨得发红，一时半会儿难以寸进。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Wild Mine Cart Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">推矿车回岔道 (0:07)（学识不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Mine Cart Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_mine_cart_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
支道尽头是一间废弃盐仓。墙边堆着更多白石，码得很整齐，像给什么东西准备的冬粮。盐仓角落有一只翻倒的木箱，箱里散着几枚旧银币、一把铜钥匙和一本被啃掉边角的工头日记。
<<if $mpClues["wild_mine_salt_den"]>><span class="teal">你对照矿道测量图上红笔标出的未登记支道，一路顺畅地摸进了废弃盐仓。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 340>>
	你抓起日记和银币，侧身挤回窄缝，在矿车撞上来之前翻过轨道。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 540>><<set _reward to 750>><<elseif _sk gte 430>><<set _reward to 560>><<else>><<set _reward to 340>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你慢了半步。矿车撞上支撑木，碎石封住窄缝，你的脚踝被落石砸中。<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[爬上麋鹿街 (0:08)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿铁轨回林间 (0:12)|Forest]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Chart Room [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
海盗船搁在礁石之间，船身向陆地一侧倾斜。你从裂开的舷窗翻进船舱，脚下立刻踩到一层湿沙。舱顶低得抬不起头，横梁上挂着断裂的铜链，随船身轻轻摆动。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-chart-room">
<<investigateicon>><<link "顺指针方向找 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-chart-room">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_chart_needle"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_chart_needle"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你对照日志里的罗经差表，认出指针偏的不是东南，而是被船体倾斜带偏的「真东南」。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石阶探看 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你被那些旧式罗经符号绕晕了，手指在玻璃罩上留下汗印。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拆校正环 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-chart-room">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_chart_needle"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_chart_needle"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你稳住呼吸沉住气观察片刻，在不起眼的夹缝间看清了端倪。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">冷风吹得你肩头微僵，稍一分神便错过了最佳时机。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回旧港栈桥 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Chart Room Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
指针对着的是一块钉死的舱板。你移开上面的空木箱，看见板缝里嵌着铜屑，像有人反复撬过又放弃。舱板后面的空间比海图室更低，海水正从一条裂缝里往外冒泡。
<<if $mpClues["wild_chart_needle"]>><span class="teal">你顺着破罗盘磁针死死指向的西南偏角，移开海图室角落的空箱露出了钉死的舱板。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-chart-room-step2">
<<caveicon>><<link "侧身挤进货舱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-chart-room-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_chart_hold"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_chart_hold"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用分规尖挑出锁孔里的蜡，铁链应声松开。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">分规尖在锁孔里断成两截，铁链反而绞得更紧。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回旧港栈桥 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "潜进船底 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-chart-room-step2">>
<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_chart_needle'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_chart_hold"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_chart_hold"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你借着旁侧遮挡掩去身形，指下轻巧地解开了最后一道束缚。<span class="green">轻巧地将卡在深处的东西收入囊中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[上前印证 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	远处响起一声突兀的异响，让你原本聚起的心神一散。<span class="red">手头力道一卸，刚才的工夫只得重头再来。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Wild Chart Room Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回旧港栈桥 (0:12)|Docks]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Chart Room Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pirate_ship">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_chart_room_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
货舱里只齐腰深的水。锡盒用蜡封着，打开后是几捆发黑的银币、两枚铜分规和一张折成小块的沿岸图。图上没有宝藏标记，只有几个淡水泉眼的位置，旁边用红笔写着船员的姓。
<<if $mpClues["wild_chart_hold"]>><span class="teal">凭着舱板缝隙里摸到的铜屑痕迹，你蹚过齐腰深的海水摸到了封蜡锡盒。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 300>>
	你先把锡盒举过水面，蹬着木架游到舱口，用肩膀顶开断桅。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 520>><<set _reward to 900>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 420>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你在舱口下方撞上断桅，锡盒脱手沉进水里。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿礁脊到海岩 (0:12)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[跳上沙滩 (0:12)|Beach]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Stone Ring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
石环在森林最深处，八块灰石围出一块不大的圆。石头表面长满灰绿的地衣，石缝里却冒出一层细软的青苔。你走近时，脚下的枯叶忽然变软了，像踩在晒过太阳的旧毯子上。
圆心的土是暖的。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林缘 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开圆心暖土 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring">>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>><<if _sk gte 340>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_stone_ring_warmth"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_warmth"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你没有退。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[前往下一处 (0:12)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">暖意越明显，你越想坐下。膝盖发软，眼前的石环像在慢慢收拢。</span><<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "沿石头查看刻痕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_stone_ring_warmth"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_warmth"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你细致比对前人留下的暗记，顺藤摸瓜找出了隐藏的门道。<span class="green">来龙去脉在你眼中已是一清二楚。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	湿冷的寒气顺着指尖往上钻，冻得你手指关节有些发僵。<span class="red">动作慢了半拍，没能赶在空档内办妥。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Stone Ring Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
暖土下面是一层灰白的木炭，炭层很厚，踩上去会陷。你拨开一角，看见下面压着排列整齐的石片，石片之间填着暗红色粉末。粉末没有味道，手指沾上后却发热。
<<if $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_warmth"]>><span class="teal">你顺着正北石柱根部残留的温热土层往下扒开，灰白木炭下果然压着排列整齐的石片。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林缘 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring-step2">
<<templeicon>><<link "等天色再暗 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_stone_ring_calendar"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_calendar"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你把八组缺口按月相顺序排开，认出它们对应的是一年中的八个节气。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:12)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">刻痕太浅，苔藓又滑，你看了半天也只认出圆点和弧线。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抬正北石头 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-stone-ring-step2">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_stone_ring_warmth'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_stone_ring_calendar"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_calendar"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你放轻呼吸贴近细看，用巧劲化解了原本僵死的卡扣。<span class="green">妥善取出了藏在夹缝里的那份收获。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤查证 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	表面那层陈年积垢滑不留手，你使出巧劲却如同打在棉花上。<span class="red">腕部酸涩难当，只能先退回原处歇息。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Wild Stone Ring Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回森林小径 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Stone Ring Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_stone_ring_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
天色暗下来后，圆心浮起一层极薄的热气。石缝里的青苔由绿转黄，像被火烤过。你按刻痕上的缺口数依次敲过八块石头，正北那块底下传来空响。
<<if $mpClues["wild_stone_ring_calendar"]>><span class="teal">对照石片间暗红粉末标出的八方节气刻度，你依次敲击石柱找到了正北底下的空腔。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 320>>
	你用肩膀顶住石头，把匣子从塌陷边缘拖出来，又踩着石环边缘翻到外圈。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 520>><<set _reward to 700>><<elseif _sk gte 410>><<set _reward to 520>><<else>><<set _reward to 320>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	石头比看上去重。你拖到一半就脱手，匣子滑回塌坑，铜皮被热气熏得发烫。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[走兽径回森林 (0:06)|Forest]]>><<pass 6>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<parkicon>><<link [[沿林道去后门 (0:08)|Park]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Salt Letter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
盐场的白堆沿着海岸排开，像一列没有顶的雪屋。风把盐粒卷起来，打在裤脚上沙沙响。工人都在远处的棚子下歇脚，晒盐池边只剩木耙和几双胶靴。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬蜡封取信纸 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_salt_letter_text"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_salt_letter_text"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你隔着玻璃认出最后一行：等潮水把信还给你，就来老码头找我。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[沿石阶探看 (0:04)|Beach]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">瓶身反光，字迹又小，你只认出「十年」和「老码头」。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回海滩浅岸 (0:03)|Beach]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "问老工人 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_salt_letter_text"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_salt_letter_text"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你用指腹顺着旧墨字迹细细摩挲，从不起眼的折角暗码里理出了头绪。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">光线昏暗难辨，你的指腹被毛糙的器物边缘磨得发烫，只得先停手细看。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|Beach]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Salt Letter Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
信纸展开后只有半页。女孩写她住在盐场西边的木屋，父亲每天傍晚收工，身上全是盐霜。她把这封信埋在最大的盐堆下，约好十年后来取。
<<if $mpClues["wild_salt_letter_text"]>><span class="teal">你认出玻璃瓶里那页褪色信纸的字迹，顺着盐场西侧的风向找到了半掩的旧木屋遗址。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter-step2">
<<walkicon>><<link "找木屋地基 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>><<if _sk gte 350>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_salt_old_house"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_salt_old_house"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你没有追问细节，只把信纸和铜币收好，问清西边木屋的地基还在不在。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Beach]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">老工人的沉默压得你喘不过气。你问得太急，他忽然起身收杯，说盐场不留外人过夜。</span><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回海滩 (0:03)|Beach]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "送信去邮所 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-salt-letter-step2">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_salt_letter_text'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_salt_old_house"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_salt_old_house"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你双手配合得严丝合缝，没有惊动四周分毫便达成了目的。<span class="green">一气呵成地将底部的旧物拢入袖中。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[上前印证 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你刚要发力，脚下的支撑物便发出一声令人心惊的轻响。<span class="red">重心微晃之下，你连忙收势退回安全处。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Wild Salt Letter Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回海滩 (0:03)|Beach]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Salt Letter Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_salt_letter_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
西边的木屋只剩四根泡黑的桩。地基被沙埋了大半，灶台的形状还能认出来。你按信背的数字找到旧盐仓，仓门早没了，里面堆着碎瓦和干海藻。墙角有一块松动的石板。
<<if $mpClues["wild_salt_old_house"]>><span class="teal">按信纸背面记下的盐垛编号，你在泡黑的屋桩后方找准了旧盐仓的石砌墙根。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 280>>
	你把铁盒顶在头上，沿着低埂外侧的硬沙走。浪打过来时，你侧身卸力，脚没有离开地面。<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 480>><<set _reward to 600>><<elseif _sk gte 380>><<set _reward to 450>><<else>><<set _reward to 260>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	一个浪头打在你膝盖后侧。你跪进水里，铁盒脱手，照片被回流卷走。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[从盐场回海岩 (0:08)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link [[顺干沙滩回镇上 (0:07)|Beach]]>><<pass 7>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Wild Loom Workshop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
麋鹿街废工坊的卷帘门卡在半空，下面垫着一块砖。你弯腰钻进去，灰尘在斜射的光里慢慢翻。屋子中央是一台被拆到一半的织机，经线还绷着，梭子停在轨道中间，像主人只是出去喝口水。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:02)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>><<link "顺丝线摸到墙后 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_loom_silk"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_loom_silk"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你拆开梭子的侧盖，里面藏着一小卷记账纸。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[前往下一处 (0:04)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">侧盖的卡榫比看上去脆。你用力一撬，盖板裂开，梭芯弹出来滚进零件堆。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回麋鹿街 (0:03)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">顺丝线摸到墙后 (0:07)（潜行不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "翻工坊送货账 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_loom_silk"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_loom_silk"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你顺着风向与光影的变化把握时机，稳稳当当地收拢了成果。<span class="green">从容不迫地把暗槽里的东西收好。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[循线追查 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	手头的工具在缝隙里卡了一下，差点脱手掉在地上。<span class="red">你惊出一身冷汗，忙把工具收回怀里。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转回麋鹿街 (0:03)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">翻工坊送货账 (0:06)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Loom Workshop Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
墙脚的钻孔后面是一条窄夹层，宽度只够一个人侧身站着。丝线从织机经轴穿过钻孔，绕在夹层里的一排小木桩上。木桩上贴着颜色标签，线头分别通向上方和地板下。
<<if $mpClues["wild_loom_silk"]>><span class="teal">顺着断轴织机下方那根绷紧的银灰丝线，你在墙脚钻孔后摸进了狭窄的维护夹层。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:02)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop-step2">
<<walkicon>><<link "钻维护通道 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop-step2">>
<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>><<if _sk gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_loom_pattern"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_loom_pattern"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><span class="green">你按孔位间距把打孔卡读成一组尺寸：门宽、窗高、一个人侧身通过的厚度。</span><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理清头绪 (0:04)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">孔位密密麻麻，你看久了眼前发花。纸包背面还有一层复写纸，蹭一下全是蓝灰。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[走回麋鹿街 (0:03)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_loom_silk'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link "剪丝线逼人出来 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#side-act-mp-wild-loom-workshop-step2">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['wild_loom_silk'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wild_loom_pattern"]>><<set $mpClues["wild_loom_pattern"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>你先用指腹探明深浅，随后一举将卡住的部位拨回正轨。<span class="green">棘手的难关被你轻描淡写地跨过。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺藤查证 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	迎面扑来的呛人灰尘让你忍住一声轻咳，手下顿失分寸。<span class="red">眼角发涩难辨细处，只好先暂缓动作。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Wild Loom Workshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">剪丝线逼人出来 (0:07)（学识不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Wild Loom Workshop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _first to true>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward>><<set _first to window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("side_loom_workshop_payout")>><</if>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
维护通道尽头是一间亮着灯的小屋。屋里摆着三台同样被拆开的织机，每台都只装了一半经线。一个系着围裙的人背对你坐在凳上，手里绕着那段银灰丝线。
<<if $mpClues["wild_loom_pattern"]>><span class="teal">对照夹层木桩上的色标次序，你推开维护通道尽头的小门，看清了三台半装织机的花纹。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _sk to ($willpower or 0)>>
<<if _sk gte 340>>
	你把打孔卡放在桌上，没有质问，只把纸包上的地址一个个念出来。<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>><<npcincr Wren love 1>><</if>>
	<<set _reward to 0>><<if _sk gte 520>><<set _reward to 800>><<elseif _sk gte 410>><<set _reward to 580>><<else>><<set _reward to 360>><</if>>
	<<if _first>><<money _reward>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	你被屋里那股甜腻的丝线味熏得发晕，质问的话说到一半就乱了。<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[从工坊回麋鹿街 (0:05)|Elk Street]]>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿后巷绕去公园 (0:08)|Park]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
/* MARKER */
